Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.68,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿A qué hora puedes\Njugar a GTA 6 en España?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:04.65,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Te lo digo en\Ntreinta segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:07.52,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Según Rockstar, el\Njuego se desbloquea
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.54,0:00:09.85,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}a {\c&H33D6FF&}medianoche,{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H33D6FF&}hora{\c&HFFFFFF&}\N{\c&H33D6FF&}local,{\c&HFFFFFF&} el jueves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.05,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}19 de noviembre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:13.21,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En la península\Ny en Baleares:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.23,0:00:15.08,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}a las {\c&H33D6FF&}doce{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H33D6FF&}en{\c&HFFFFFF&}\N{\c&H33D6FF&}punto{\c&HFFFFFF&} de la noche
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:16.57,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}del miércoles\Nal jueves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.10,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En Canarias, ojo:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.36,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}la tienda suele\Ntratar a España como
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.38,0:00:22.78,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}una sola región, así\Nque podría abrirse
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.80,0:00:25.09,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}a las {\c&H33D6FF&}once{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H33D6FF&}de{\c&HFFFFFF&} {\c&H33D6FF&}la{\c&HFFFFFF&}\N{\c&H33D6FF&}noche{\c&HFFFFFF&} del miércoles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.24,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Mira la cuenta\Natrás en tu tienda.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:29.30,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y si lo tienes\Nen digital,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.32,0:00:31.12,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}la precarga ya\Nestá abierta:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.14,0:00:33.57,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}descárgalo hoy y deja\Nespacio de sobra.
